From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Market Canopy <office@marketcanopy.invalid>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Market Canopy Office identity on macOS

Bundle identifier com.marketcanopy.office and product name for the
arm64 and x86_64 targets, display name, the mc-office URL scheme,
copyright, permission texts, help and sign-up destinations, About
links, and the Sparkle feed and public key as build settings the
release passes (OFFICE_SPARKLE_FEED_URL, OFFICE_SPARKLE_PUBLIC_KEY),
so no build can update from ONLYOFFICE's feed or trust its key. The
fastlane lane no longer turns on the Enterprise add-on mode.
---
